vmctl

The Go command uses Cobra, pflag, and mousetrap under their respective
upstream licenses. Dependency versions are recorded in go.mod and go.sum.

The optional runtime image is built locally from Debian packages, including
QEMU, OVMF, and swtpm. These components retain their own licenses and are
not relicensed by this project. A source release does not include runtime
images, operating-system installation media, firmware binaries, or guest
licenses. Anyone redistributing a built runtime image must satisfy the
licenses and corresponding-source obligations of its included packages.

Example configurations do not grant rights to distribute guest operating
systems. Installation media and any required licenses must be supplied by
the user.
